msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Triton-Ascend\n"
"\n"
"Triton-Ascend is a backend plugin for the Triton compiler. It enables Triton to run on Ascend NPU.\n"
"\n"
"## Introduction\n"
"\n"
"Triton-Ascend is a backend plugin for the Triton compiler. It enables Triton to run on Ascend NPU.\n"
"\n"
"## Environmental Dependencies\n"
"\n"
"### Triton\n"
"\n"
"Triton-Ascend depends on Triton. For details about the supported Triton version, see the [Triton-Ascend repository](https://gitee.com/ascend/triton-ascend).\n"
"\n"
"### CANN\n"
"\n"
"Triton-Ascend depends on CANN. For details about the supported CANN version, see the [Triton-Ascend repository](https://gitee.com/ascend/triton-ascend).\n"
"\n"
"### PyTorch and torch\\_npu\n"
"\n"
"Triton-Ascend depends on PyTorch and torch\\_npu. For details about the supported PyTorch and torch\\_npu versions, see the [Triton-Ascend repository](https://gitee.com/ascend/triton-ascend).\n"
"\n"
"## Installation\n"
"\n"
"### Installing Dependencies\n"
"\n"
"Before installing Triton-Ascend, install Triton, CANN, PyTorch, and torch\\_npu. For details about the installation, see the [Triton-Ascend repository](https://gitee.com/ascend/triton-ascend).\n"
"\n"
"### Installing Triton-Ascend\n"
"\n"
"You can install Triton-Ascend from a wheel package or source code. For details about the installation, see the [Triton-Ascend repository](https://gitee.com/ascend/triton-ascend).\n"
"\n"
"## Usage\n"
"\n"
"### Using Triton-Ascend in PyTorch\n"
"\n"
"To use Triton-Ascend in PyTorch, set the `TRITON_KERNEL_CACHE_DIR` environment variable to a local path. This path is used to store the compiled kernel cache.\n"
"\n"
"### Using Triton-Ascend in vLLM\n"
"\n"
"To use Triton-Ascend in vLLM, set the `TRITON_KERNEL_CACHE_DIR` environment variable to a local path. This path is used to store the compiled kernel cache.\n"
"\n"
"## Documentation\n"
"\n"
"For more information, see the [Triton-Ascend documentation](https://triton-ascend.readthedocs.io/).\n"
"\n"
"## Contribution\n"
"\n"
"Triton-Ascend is an open-source project. We welcome contributions from the community. For details about how to contribute, see the [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://gitee.com/ascend/triton-ascend/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md) file.\n"
"\n"
"## License\n"
"\n"
"Triton-Ascend is licensed under the [MIT License](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT).\n"

